Apply the exact gate to FacilityResolution: Closure requires the defined outcome evidence or an explicit accepted monitoring state. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
